<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Opatovice power H1 pretax falls.</title>
<headline>Czech Opatovice power H1 pretax falls.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech power generating company Elektrarny Opatovice a.s. said on Tuesday that its first-half pre-tax profit fell to 371.7 million crowns from 531.9 million for the same period last year.  </p>
<p>(in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> pre-tax profit		     371.735   vs    531.914</p>
<p> operating profit		   497.780   vs    517.773</p>
<p> depreciation			  78.408   vs     85.433</p>
<p> sales of own goods/services  1,279.407   vs  1,407.483</p>
<p> sales of other goods		 4.840   vs	0.084</p>
<p> basic capital		    1,311.621   vs  1,311.621</p>
<p> assets			     9,972.199   vs  5,677.112</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
